{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Joymaker is an indie horror game set in a toy factory. Play as a mysterious figure, by the name of John, with strange tasks scrawled in his journal, and unravel the secrets of this terrible place and the mind of a man who has lost everything.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/18292c5c057441f14ce4afc5e060a541.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1558 height=875 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow John through 5 days of &quot;work&quot; in a factory that's been abandoned for a year. Craft the toys on the to-do list in your journal at workbenches you will find throughout the toy factory. Complete the list before you go home for the day.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/c46765133135c5bd7326cdb6bf8cd39f.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1559 height=879 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Be careful. You are not alone in this place. While you do your job, you might find that something is lurking in the dark behind you. You can turn around to see where it is, but you must turn away from it to continue work.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/f15abfce47822859260f82be43c4b8ae.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1556 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Never forget to take your Happy Pills! Everything is more normal when you take them, when you can't remember why you need them. There are consequences if you go for extended periods without them.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/d155bc4a79951d3716c51a6be9589682.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1555 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the dark, your lantern is your guide and your only shield. That <i>thing</i> does not like the light. Remember that you can stand up at any time, but it is likely a bad idea to do so while it's nearby. Scare it away first to safely leave the workbench.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/133895e8bc32d0a02edea71f8446971e.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do not, however, make the mistake of believing you are safe. While you make less noise traversing the factory than working, it still hunts. The light may scare it, but if it gets close enough, nothing will stop it. Pray that does not happen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/ef4bef883f75653fe455bbca9a77b770.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1553 height=876 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943260?t=1755734167","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/589c51d4a471c033331eb4c0e08b85daf7a24c90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755734167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/1c2cba7fab6baaeb02d2f1f4fa7d1dc3353f1c51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755734167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/1c2cba7fab6baaeb02d2f1f4fa7d1dc3353f1c51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755734167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains frightening scenes, jumpscares, abuse of fictional legal drugs, and implied/described brutal death."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Joymaker is an indie horror game set in a toy factory. Play as a mysterious figure, by the name of John, with strange tasks scrawled in his journal, and unravel the secrets of this terrible place and the mind of a man who has lost everything.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/18292c5c057441f14ce4afc5e060a541.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1558 height=875 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow John through 5 days of &quot;work&quot; in a factory that's been abandoned for a year. Craft the toys on the to-do list in your journal at workbenches you will find throughout the toy factory. Complete the list before you go home for the day.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/c46765133135c5bd7326cdb6bf8cd39f.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1559 height=879 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Be careful. You are not alone in this place. While you do your job, you might find that something is lurking in the dark behind you. You can turn around to see where it is, but you must turn away from it to continue work.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/f15abfce47822859260f82be43c4b8ae.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1556 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Never forget to take your Happy Pills! Everything is more normal when you take them, when you can't remember why you need them. There are consequences if you go for extended periods without them.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/d155bc4a79951d3716c51a6be9589682.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1555 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the dark, your lantern is your guide and your only shield. That <i>thing</i> does not like the light. Remember that you can stand up at any time, but it is likely a bad idea to do so while it's nearby. Scare it away first to safely leave the workbench.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/133895e8bc32d0a02edea71f8446971e.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do not, however, make the mistake of believing you are safe. While you make less noise traversing the factory than working, it still hunts. The light may scare it, but if it gets close enough, nothing will stop it. Pray that does not happen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/extras/ef4bef883f75653fe455bbca9a77b770.avif?t=1755734167\" width=1553 height=876 /></span></p>","developers":["Several Confused Clowns"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943260/bfc6726ae08efab8c7806e727fb45981fa3edbe2/header.jpg?t=1755734167","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-4590<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 390<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184621,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184621/movie480.mp4?t=1755734165","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184621/movie_max.mp4?t=1755734165"},"name":"Joymaker Announcement Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184621/812a8068f2aa1722fce4bef73700beec1c262720/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755734165","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184621/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755734165","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184621/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755734165"}}],"name":"Joymaker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i